        </p>

        <details>
          <summary>Show suggested answer</summary>

          <p class="answer">
            External AI chatbot.
          </p>

          <p>
            This is a general learning question and does not
            require access to a complete project.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>

      <div class="activity-card">
        <h3>Situation 2</h3>

        <p>
          A developer is writing a function, and the editor
          predicts the next several lines.
        </p>

        <details>
          <summary>Show suggested answer</summary>

          <p class="answer">
            AI code-completion tool.
          </p>

          <p>
            The tool is predicting code from the current file
            and surrounding context.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>

      <div class="activity-card">
        <h3>Situation 3</h3>

        <p>
          A developer wants a tool to inspect the project,
