          </p>

          <p>
            The tool examines proposed code changes and adds
            review comments.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>

      <h3>Instruction-Writing Practice</h3>

      <p>
        Improve the following unclear instruction:
      </p>

      <pre><code>Fix my website.</code></pre>

      <p>
        A clearer instruction could be:
      </p>

      <pre><code>Inspect the home page and find why the Register button
does not open the registration page.

Do not redesign the page.
Do not change the payment files.
Explain the cause before making changes.
After the change, tell me which file was updated.</code></pre>

      <div class="success">
        Clear instructions reduce unnecessary changes and make
        AI-agent work easier to review.
      </div>
    </section>

