      <ul class="remember-list">
        <li>
          External AI chatbots are useful for general questions,
          explanations, planning, and small examples.
        </li>

        <li>
          Code-completion tools suggest code while you work
          inside the editor.
        </li>

        <li>
          Coding agents can perform larger tasks and may change
          multiple project files.
